# Per-run gate records. Regenerated by scripts/ci-gates.sh on every exit path, so
# committing them would be pure churn in a repo that already has a concurrent
# auto-committer. LOOP-STATUS.md and loop-history.jsonl are the committed,
# bounded summaries; this directory is the raw per-run detail.
#
# .gate-runs/logs/ holds one <GATE_ID>.log per gate plus RUN.stamp, each
# stamped with the run's start time. scripts/check-gate-skips.mjs reads them to
# account for skipped assertions; they are per-run detail, not a committed record.
.gate-runs/
